==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Lost Thunder|Brionne|66}} from the {{TCG|Lost Thunder}} expansion.
**Both cards have the {{m|Water Gun}} attack; this is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Brionne}} can learn.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Brionne}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

